  deathMessages:
  - '"I am surrounded by fearful odds that will overcome my gallant men and me, but
    I am pleased to die fighting for my beloved country."'
  - '"What I do is done for my beloved country. No sacrifice can be too great."'
  - '"A life that is not dedicated to a great and noble cause is like a tree without
    shade, if not a poisonous weed." '
  - '"Regardless of the color of their skin, all people are equal; one may be superior
